    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pocket Rogues</strong> is a dynamic, old-school <strong>Action-RPG</strong> with <strong>Roguelike</strong> elements. Here, you\u2019ll fight your way through hordes of monsters, explore unique, randomly generated locations, and develop your own fortress and heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946610/extras/68db6ba23a297b3e74ff3c38b3e5ccd8.poster.avif?t=1745597421\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946610/extras/68db6ba23a297b3e74ff3c38b3e5ccd8.webm?t=1745597421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946610/extras/68db6ba23a297b3e74ff3c38b3e5ccd8.mp4?t=1745597421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Pocket Rogues</strong>, you\u2019ll discover dozens of dungeons filled with unique loot and monsters, a variety of hero classes, and terrifying bosses\u2014each encounter presenting a true challenge. <strong>Traditional RPG elements, such as character progression and exploration, ensure you\u2019ll never get bored!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946610/extras/fcfd80142b74f268571b3401f1a85e19.poster.avif?t=1745597421\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946610/extras/fcfd80142b74f268571b3401f1a85e19.webm?t=1745597421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946610/extras/fcfd80142b74f268571b3401f1a85e19.mp4?t=1745597421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;For centuries, this dark dungeon has lured hapless travelers with its secrets and treasures. One by one, they vanished, consumed by true Evil. Yet grim legends only fuel the desires of ever more adventurers. Why not become one of them?!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946610/extras/e45625c8d41c69e1814f337099cd110d.poster.avif?t=1745597421\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946610/extras/e45625c8d41c69e1814f337099cd110d.webm?t=1745597421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946610/extras/e45625c8d41c69e1814f337099cd110d.mp4?t=1745597421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>FEATURES:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Completely real-time gameplay</u>!</strong> Move, dodge, and flank your enemies! The combat system emphasizes precise character control and player skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Multiple hero classes</u>:</strong> Each class has unique skills, specialized equipment, and its own development tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Every descent is unique</u>!</strong> From locations and monsters to loot and random encounters, everything is procedurally generated. No two dungeons are ever the same!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Distinct locations</u>:</strong> Each one features its own visual style, unique enemies, traps, and interactive objects. Move freely between all unlocked locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Build your own fortress</u>:</strong> Construct and upgrade buildings in your Guild Fortress to unlock and enhance new heroes and gain access to new game mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Regular updates</u>:</strong> The game has been actively supported and developed over time, with constant input from the community and dedicated players.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pocket Rogues</strong> is a dynamic, old-school <strong>Action-RPG</strong> with <strong>Roguelike</strong> elements. Here, you\u2019ll fight your way through hordes of monsters, explore unique, randomly generated locations, and develop your own fortress and heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946610/extras/68db6ba23a297b3e74ff3c38b3e5ccd8.poster.avif?t=1745597421\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946610/extras/68db6ba23a297b3e74ff3c38b3e5ccd8.webm?t=1745597421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946610/extras/68db6ba23a297b3e74ff3c38b3e5ccd8.mp4?t=1745597421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Pocket Rogues</strong>, you\u2019ll discover dozens of dungeons filled with unique loot and monsters, a variety of hero classes, and terrifying bosses\u2014each encounter presenting a true challenge. <strong>Traditional RPG elements, such as character progression and exploration, ensure you\u2019ll never get bored!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946610/extras/fcfd80142b74f268571b3401f1a85e19.poster.avif?t=1745597421\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946610/extras/fcfd80142b74f268571b3401f1a85e19.webm?t=1745597421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946610/extras/fcfd80142b74f268571b3401f1a85e19.mp4?t=1745597421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;For centuries, this dark dungeon has lured hapless travelers with its secrets and treasures. One by one, they vanished, consumed by true Evil. Yet grim legends only fuel the desires of ever more adventurers. Why not become one of them?!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946610/extras/e45625c8d41c69e1814f337099cd110d.poster.avif?t=1745597421\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946610/extras/e45625c8d41c69e1814f337099cd110d.webm?t=1745597421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946610/extras/e45625c8d41c69e1814f337099cd110d.mp4?t=1745597421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>FEATURES:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Completely real-time gameplay</u>!</strong> Move, dodge, and flank your enemies! The combat system emphasizes precise character control and player skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Multiple hero classes</u>:</strong> Each class has unique skills, specialized equipment, and its own development tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Every descent is unique</u>!</strong> From locations and monsters to loot and random encounters, everything is procedurally generated. No two dungeons are ever the same!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Distinct locations</u>:</strong> Each one features its own visual style, unique enemies, traps, and interactive objects. Move freely between all unlocked locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Build your own fortress</u>:</strong> Construct and upgrade buildings in your Guild Fortress to unlock and enhance new heroes and gain access to new game mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Regular updates</u>:</strong> The game has been actively supported and developed over time, with constant input from the community and dedicated players.</p></li></ul>",
